title: BrokenSpire
tags: 
position: -276,-171
---
<<SetExpression idle smile>>
Molly: This pool is pretty, but...
<<SetExpression idle annoyed>>
Molly: ...everything is so worn down.
<<SetExpression surprise annoyed>>
Molly: I wish somone would tell me where I am.
<<SwapSpeakers>>
King's Ghost: This was one of my favorite spots in the kingdom.
King's Ghost: When I was alive, that is.
King's Ghost: I would sit and think, surrounded by the forest.
King's Ghost: The peace and tranqulity were exceptional.
King's Ghost: I have a strong feeling I met someone important in this very spot.
<<SetExpression idle smile>>
<<SwapSpeakers>>
Molly: Interesting...
<<SetExpression idle smirk>>
Molly: ...but not very helpful.
Molly: I'm guessing you have no idea who that was?
<<SwapSpeakers>>
King's Ghost: You would be correct.
<<SetExpression idle annoyed>>
<<SwapSpeakers>>
Molly: Hmmm...
