title: Demo1
tags: 
position: 115,-198
---
<<SetExpression idle smile>>
Molly: Ok, so here's my day so far.
<<SetExpression idle annoyed>>
<<SwapSpeakers>>
Molly: Meena chased me home after school today.
<<SetExpression surprise surprise>>
<<SwapSpeakers>>
Molly: I had to flee for my life!
<<SetExpression surprise frown>>
<<SwapSpeakers>>
Molly: I was going so fast, I didn't see the magic hole in the sidewalk.
<<SetExpression idle smirk>>
<<SwapSpeakers>>
Molly: Dumb mistake, right?
<<SetExpression surprise annoyed>>
<<SwapSpeakers>>
Molly: Well, I fell in and landed in some kind of park, I think?
<<SetExpression idle annoyed>>
<<SwapSpeakers>>
Molly: Inside I found a dead guy, who I guess used to be a king or something?
<<SetExpression surprise annoyed>>
Molly: At first, I thought he was scary, but then he gave me a magic stick.
<<SetExpression idle smile>>
Molly: And now I can summon magical animals.
<<SetExpression idle smirk>>
Molly: Well, one magical animal. 
Molly: A frog.
Molly: I hope he's stronger than he looks.
<<SetExpression surprise smile>>
Molly: So technically, I'm a wizard now?
<<SetExpression surprise annoyed>>
Molly: Or is it a witch?
Molly: I dunno.
<<SetExpression idle smile>>
Molly: Make sense?
<<SetExpression idle smirk>>
Molly: Yeah, I don't get it either.
<<SetExpression surprise frown>>
Molly: I just want to go home!
<<SetExpression idle frown>>
Molly: But apparently, that's not an option.
Molly: So I'm stuck here looking for answers...
Molly: ...with only a memory-challlenged ghost to talk to.
<<SwapSpeakers>>
King's Ghost: I beg your pardon!
<<SwapSpeakers>>
<<SetExpression idle annoyed>>
Molly: Hey, I'm not the one here who can't remember my own name.
<<SetExpression idle smirk>>
Molly: No offense.
<<SwapSpeakers>>
King's Ghost: Hmph.
<<SwapSpeakers>>
<<SetExpression idle smirk>>
Molly: We've got to think of something better to call you than "King's Ghost".
<<SwapSpeakers>>
King's Ghost: That may be so, but let us please focus on the task at hand!
<<SwapSpeakers>>
Molly: Geez, you talk funny.
<<SetExpression idle annoyed>>
Molly: Fine.
<<set $demo_played to 1>>
<<SetExpression idle smile>>
Molly: Let's look around for these "unfamiliar" things then.
Molly: I hear some strange noises coming from the east...
