title: ForestTemple
---
<<SetExpression idle annoyed>>
Molly: What is this place anyway?
<<SwapSpeakers>>
King's Ghost: I know it may not look like much, but this is all that remains of the forest temple.
King's Ghost: People would gather here every year to pay their respects to To'leti.
King's Ghost: And it would bless them with growth and prosperity.
<<SwapSpeakers>>
<<SetExpression idle annoyed>>
Molly: You know all of that, but you can't remember what wrecked the place?
<<SwapSpeakers>>
King's Ghost: Sadly, no...
King's Ghost: Let's move on, shall we?
